{'symbol': 'VICI', 'date': '2021-11-01 16:15:00', 'title': "CAESARS ENTERTAINMENT AND VICI PROPERTIES COMPLETE SALE OF HARRAH'S LOUISIANA DOWNS", 'text': 'LAS VEGAS AND NEW YORK, NOV. 1, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0CAESARS ENTERTAINMENT, INC. (NASDAQ: CZR) ("CAESARS ENTERTAINMENT" OR "CAESARS") AND VICI PROPERTIES INC. (NYSE:VICI) ("VICI PROPERTIES" OR "VICI") TODAY ANNOUNCED THEY HAVE COMPLETED THE PREVIOUSLY DISCLOSED TRANSACTION TO SELL HARRAH\'S LOUISIANA DOWNS CASINO, RACING & ENTERTAINMENT ("HARRAH\'S LOUISIANA DOWNS") TO RUBICO ACQUISITION CORP. FOR $22.0 MILLION. \xa0THE PROCEEDS OF THE TRANSACTION WERE SPLIT $5.5 MILLION TO VICI AND $16.5 MILLION TO CAESARS SUBJECT TO CUSTOMARY ADJUSTMENTS FOR CASH AND NET WORKING CAPITAL.'}